<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 10, 2004 :: Lots of old news..</div><P>I had a picture, it was snazzy and all, but I can't seem to find it.. I'll get a replacement though! Grats Garetjax on completing your epic blades finally! They make you look extra sexay!<BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/gj1.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Reivan on completing your Staff of the Four as well! <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/reivan.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Had a few more visits to Sleepers, more folks got prismatic, killed some uglies in Plane of Disease, got another person keyed for Sleepers, killed the great white dragon again. And... some levels!</P>
<P>Grats Kasiryn on 65 and Prophet!<BR>Grats Valenae on 65 and Arch Lich!<BR>Grats Punkgurl on 60 and Crusader!<BR>Grats Perragon and Wellish on 59!<BR>Grats Dalorm on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Kaisey on 52!<BR>Grats Myistical on 46!<BR>Grats Turtleman on 42!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 11, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 4, 2004 :: Grats Talyss and Beryllin!!</div><P>Big grats to the newly married couple!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/wedding.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 5, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 3, 2004 :: Happy New Year!</div><P>With the new year we got ourselves some new levels!<BR>Grats Bashiuss on 65 and Dread Lord!<BR>Grats Mytee on 65 and Coercer!<BR>Grats Iionz&nbsp;on 60 and Assassin!<BR>Grats Aelfric on 60 and Warder!<BR>Grats Zorin on 60 (and 61) and High Priest!<BR>Grats Punkgurl and Mabh on 57!<BR>Grats Gargaden on 55 and Luminary!<BR>Grats Scheni on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Turtleman on 40!</P>
<P>Visited the big ugly in Fear and killed him, killing his friends along the way. Golems were very cheap, as always. Grats Morlith on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics3/soulleech.jpg">Soul Leech</A>, Lumalie and Moordread each got <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/zombie_flesh_bracer.jpg">Zombie Flesh Bracers</A>, Colwn and Kantar got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/brainofcazicthule.jpg">Brain of Cazic Thule</A> and Beryllin and Lairiel both got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/cloakofthefearsome.jpg">Cloak of the Fearsome</A>. </P>
<P>Weekly Sleepers visit found Arglar with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Warsword.jpg">new sword</A>, Jen with a pretty <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Lance.jpg">lance</A>, Papa with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Guilded_Wyvern_Claw.jpg">new neck</A>, Wonder with <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/wings_of_duress.jpg">some wings</A> and more quest items for the questers. </P>
<P>Klandicar donated a neck for Arglar, and we ran the dwarfie to visit the big dead guy for his key. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 30, 2003 :: Undead horsey!</div><P>Looked around for something to do, and found Vhaksiz the Shade up and waiting to die. Rounded up some folks and crawled through the caves up to his penthouse apartment and killed him. Grats Thayet on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/flame_engraved_torque.jpeg">Flame Engraved Torque</A> and greed roll winners on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/disemboweler.jpg">Disembowler</A> and <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/BlackSilkCap.jpg">Black Silk Cap</A>, a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/sinew_tied_bone_earring.jpeg">Sinew Tied Bone Earring</A> found on the way up. </P>
<P>Sure there's been more leveling, and I nominate Wonderous to update that! ;)</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 29, 2003 :: Weekend updates</div><P>Let's see, kind of quiet around here with the holidays. Mabh led some folks to take down some of her epic mobs. A few of us headed into Sleepers still hoping for Mahrsan's fistwraps, but still no luck there.. Grats Meeka on an ancient prismatic staff!</P>
<P>Killed the Dain twice, grats Reide and Aridius on Dain's head, Leviathaun and Perragon on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/Frostreaver.jpg">Frostreaver</A>, Ccra on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/frostreavers_embroidered_cloak.jpg">Frostreaver's Embroidered Cloak</A>, Tristastar on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Ring_of_Winter.jpg">Ring of Winter</A>, Perragon on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6736">Aegis of Ice</A>! Papajay saved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/frostreavers_velium_crown.jpg">Frostreaver's Velium Crown</A> from rotting and a couple Ring of Winter and Shield of the Seneschals went to Greed!</P>
<P>Did the Ring War for Raihndance as well! Grats on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Morlith on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Kahln on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Saragoth on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A>, Wellish on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A>! <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6893">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A> and <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A> went to some Greed roll winners. </P>
<P>Leveling grats!<BR>Grats Mytee on 64!<BR>Grats Sparkley and Softeyes on 61!<BR>Grats Perragon and 57!<BR>Grats Tidark on 55 and Myrmidon!<BR>Leviathaun 54th!<BR>Grats Mabh on 55!<BR>Dalorm 53rd!<BR>Grats Thiia on 41!<BR>Fopu 30th!<BR></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Dec 29, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 22, 2003 :: Grats Anarandil on 65!!</div><P>Grats to the newest 65 paladin, Anarandil! <BR>I know others have leveled, and I'll add those later. I think I made level updates Wonderous' job anyways.. /smirks</P>
<P>Wonderous led folks into ToV for some hunting, and I heard a few nice drops being said, but I wasn't there so I'm a bit lost at giving an update. So I'll have to make some stuff up. .. erm.. Grats Wonderous on your full set of chain! Grats Bery on some silk boxers for the holiday! Grats Morlith on your death, I'm sure! /nods</P>
<P>..... Wonderous wanders in .....</P>
<P>Oh yes.. the raid.. we had a gorgeous Chain Breastplate head to MQ-Land, a Plate Bracer that headed over to Morlith's grasping hands and some Plate Arms that looked quite fetching on Duktak's arms /whistle!</P>
<P>Now if I just remember to take attendance ;)</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Dec 23, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 21, 2003 :: Patches are evil</div><P>However, we got to kill MotG twice with the servers crashing on Friday! Sure, it was real exciting to have everyone log back on at his feet the second time, but can't beat killing him twice!</P>
<P>Some late grats on leveling..<BR><BR>Grats Zorin on 60 and High Priest!<BR>Grats Mytee on 63!<BR>Grats Wellish on 57!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 18, 2003 :: Mujaki Devoured</div><P>Despite the servers eating our MT and SA during the fight and them unable to log back on, we killed him. Grats Dorina on your earring, Edenstar on your cloak, and I got booted before rolling off the other loot we got on the way there. Will update this later!</P>
<P>Grats Yimish on 65 and Overlord!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 61!<BR>Um... know I forgot more...</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=4'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a> <a href='news.asp?page=4'>4</a> 5 <a href='news.asp?page=6'>6</a> <a href='news.asp?page=7'>7</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=6'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
